SUMMARY:Impromptu: LV Down on the Farm (21F) (11-12mph)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is a "fun" ride no o
 ne will be left behind. Re-grouping stops as needed.\n\nRide leader: Jon H
 artung\nSweep: Ann Morris\n\nAnticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRoute:
  [LV Down on the Farm (21F) - Lancaster Bike Club](https://routes.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/cue/lv-down-on-the-farm-21f/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride a
 t the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a
  no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to ke
 ep the group together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also b
 e appointed at the start. Please do not join this ride if you are not will
 ing to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be ri
 ding by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining 
 a 11-12 mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider
  joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please
  bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 i
 nflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we requi
 re LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on M
 eetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here Member Signup Your RS
 VP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Condu
 ct Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
