SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LI - Whiff Roasters ride (28R) 
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\nA nice ride north\, east and south of Lititz. Not a lot of climbing. Th
 e route includes a stop at Whiff Roasters for some great coffee. The pace 
 will be 14 - 16 mph average. Multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5).\n\nThi
 s ride is a social ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one gro
 up. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportiv
 e of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off 
 the back of the last group.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[https://ride
 withgps.com/routes/55339071?privacy_code=cTA6dHUWOZ8stlDWlqzMXSxggKLDJ9LO]
 (https://ridewithgps.com/routes/55339071?privacy_code=cTA6dHUWOZ8stlDWlqzM
 XSxggKLDJ9LO)\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 wat
 er bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 i
 nflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club member. Use 
 this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.as
 px?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.as
 px?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the
  club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpr
 ess.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nand Rule
 s of the Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https:
 //lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modu
 le_id=325159)
